[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 794.23, "timestamp": "00:13:14", "text": "你建造什麼都不會破壞，它會一直存在，就像在 NRA 的地方一樣，對吧？你來這裡，來這裡，來這裡，跟我一起來，我是粉紅色的。  是的。是的。你看到這條藍色的線了嗎？  你看到了嗎？是的。所以在這個區域內，無論他建造什麼，都不會"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 797.942, "timestamp": "00:13:17", "author": "@Ghewar_Ji_ka_No-1FAN", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/CqrtcQvHFvr33XJk7uI96qZ5HyIAEb1ifU1jdPzM7vetPMlUZ4oYhF9BjVOj5xYYbkMi18Zfvg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAEUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAEUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAE"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 802.23, "timestamp": "00:13:22", "text": "損壞，他的朋友也會自己修理。但如果他像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 804.31, "timestamp": "00:13:24", "text": "建造其他東西那樣破壞它，那麼它就會破滅。  所以你需要一個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 809.509, "timestamp": "00:13:29", "text": "PAL 盒子，你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 812.87, "timestamp": "00:13:32", "text": "像 PAL 裝置一樣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 815.91, "timestamp": "00:13:35", "text": "獲得它，就像你按下 B 鍵進入 PAL"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 824.55, "timestamp": "00:13:44", "text": "模式時，就能得到"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 826.573, "timestamp": "00:13:46", "author": "@Legend__8055-7", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/h7rPbxlZLgAoQ4WQreLmN5CGuBDaAqrOcRu5IS2bB9ZxFUTHgdnW1GYPK4UM2if6lNaCX_KYaLU=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/egJ1XufTKYfegwOo57ewAg"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 827.766, "timestamp": "00:13:47", "author": "@redx7454", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ZnCeavb1XjhCUyF0gPZf2zqHWkwDjnzleyD1oxpd-9re-emmqNet6n-8w_OiHe_rvcNpzZPLgw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/egJ1XufTKYfegwOo57ewAg"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 828.47, "timestamp": "00:13:48", "text": "PAL 盒子，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 830.87, "timestamp": "00:13:50", "text": "對吧？但你現在還不能放置它，我們首先"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 837.11, "timestamp": "00:13:57", "text": "需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 839.269, "timestamp": "00:13:59", "text": "升級，也就是進入「願景之地」模式。我已經有了 PAL 盒子，是的，但是我們不能放置它，因為數量限制為兩個，你必須去那裡放置盒子。  所以，它要"}]